{
  "name": "@dsh-android/dsh-android-zorvai-tools",
  "description": "ZorvAI 宿主能力内置插件通道（互控多通道之一）：把 ZorvAI 的工具集以原生插件形态注册进 harness（zorvai_* 前缀，deferLoading 渐进披露），execute 走壳侧 127.0.0.1 纯 HTTP 面（POST /tool/<name>）；与 app 侧运行时写入的 MCP 通道（mcp__zorvai__*）是同一批工具两条路",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "private": true,
  "scripts": {
    "build": "tsc -p .",
    "test": "node --test test/*.test.mjs"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "4.0.5",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": "0.2.1-rc.2"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "4.0.5",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": "0.2.1-rc.2",
    "@types/node": "^24.0.0",
    "typescript": "^5.5.0"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/kelai141/dsh-mobile.git"
  }
}
